OL,3,AGuinea-Bissau referendum approves new
OL,4,Aconstitution that expands president's
OL,5,Apowers
OL,6,
OL,7,FVoters in Guinea-Bissau have approved a
OL,8,Fnew constitution that significantly
OL,9,Fexpands presidential powers ahead of
OL,10,Fgeneral elections later this year.
OL,12,FThe referendum was organised by the
OL,13,Fmilitary government that seized power
OL,14,Fin the West African nation last
OL,15,FNovember following a disputed election.
OL,17,FVoters have agreed to sweeping reforms
OL,18,Fallowing the president to appoint and
OL,19,Fdismiss the b@Kprime minister and
OL,20,Fcabinet, create or abolish ministries
OL,21,Fand dissolve parliament in bA the event
OL,22,Fof a grave political crisis.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
