OL,3,AGuinea-Bissau referendum approves new
OL,4,Aconstitution that expands president's
OL,5,Apowers
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe main opposition party boycotted the
OL,8,Fvote, saying the process lacked
OL,9,Fadequate political and institutional
OL,10,Fsafeguards and threatened the country's
OL,11,Ftransition back to democracy.
